  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "温厚な　気質など　相違点　あれどもバスラオの　特徴を　多く　有すゆえそのリージョンフォームと　定義す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "물길을 거슬러 오르는 여정에서 뜻을 이루지 못하고 죽은 동료들의 혼을 두르고 있다. 히스이에 흐르는 하천에서는 대적할 자가 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在溯河而上的旅程中半途喪命者的靈魂纏繞其身。在流經洗翠地區的河川裡可謂所向無敵。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon revêt les âmes de ses camarades qui ont péri en remontant les rivières. Dans les fleuves qui traversent Hisui, aucune autre espèce n’est à sa mesure.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hüllt sich in die Seelen von Artgenossen, die auf der Reise stromaufwärts ihr Leben ließen. In den Flüssen Hisuis findet sich kein Lebewesen, welches ihm das Wasser reichen könnte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Durante las remontadas de los ríos, se envuelve de las almas de sus congéneres caídos en la ardua travesía. No tiene rival en ninguna de las corrientes que fluyen por la región de Hisui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È avvolto dagli spiriti dei suoi simili caduti durante l’ardua risalita da foce a sorgente. Nessuna tra le forme di vita che abitano i fiumi di Hisui è in grado di tenergli testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Clads itself in the souls of comrades that perished before fulfilling their goals of journeying upstream. No other species throughout all Hisui’s rivers is Basculegion’s equal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "遡上の旅路にて　志半ばに　散った輩の魂を　まとう。　ヒスイ　流れし河川においては　敵うもの　皆無なり。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在溯河而上的旅程中半途丧命的伙伴的灵魂缠绕其身。在流经洗翠地区的河川里可谓所向无敌。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Durante las remontadas de los ríos, se envuelve de las almas de sus congéneres caídos en la ardua travesía. No tiene rival en ninguna de las corrientes que fluyen por la región de Hisui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "うまれた　かわを　めざす　かこくなみちのりで　しんでいった　なかまのたましいを　からだに　まとっている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "태어난 강으로 향하는 가혹한 여정 중에 목숨을 잃은 동료들의 영혼을 몸에 두르고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身上時刻纏繞著在回到出生河川的艱辛旅途中半途喪命的夥伴的靈魂。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps est enveloppé des âmes de ses congénères qui ont perdu la vie sur le périlleux chemin menant à la rivière où ils sont nés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hüllt seinen Körper in die Seelen von Artgenossen, die auf dem beschwerlichen Weg zum Fluss ihrer Geburt ihr Leben ließen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuerpo está envuelto en las almas de los compañeros que perecieron durante el arduo viaje para regresar al río que los vio nacer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È avvolto dagli spiriti dei suoi simili, morti nell’estenuante viaggio verso il fiume in cui erano nati.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon is cloaked in the souls of its comrades who perished during a punishing journey to the river of their birth.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "生まれた　川を　目指す　過酷な道のりで　死んでいった　仲間の魂を　体に　まとっている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在前往出生的河川的艰苦旅程中丧命的伙伴的灵魂时刻缠绕在它的身上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuerpo está envuelto en las almas de los compañeros que perecieron durante el arduo viaje para regresar al río que los vio nacer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すさまじい　ジャンプりょくを　もつ。しんでいった　なかまたちの　いかりがからだを　あかく　そめあげている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가공할 만한 점프력을 가졌다. 죽은 동료들의 분노가 몸을 붉게 물들였다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有驚人的跳躍力。死去的夥伴們的怒火染紅了牠的身體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon peut faire des bonds vertigineux. La colère de ses défunts congénères a donné à son corps une teinte rouge.",
